  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Design & access statement, flood risk assessment, fire statement, Received: 18/07/2022; 01-B, 02-B, 03-B, 04-B, 05-C, 06-B, 07-B, 08-E, 09-C, 10-D, 11-E, 12-E, 13-E, 14-E, 15-E & location plan Received: 02/08/2022) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to occupation, secure and covered cycle parking facilities (for not less than 2 bicycles) shall be made available and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction."
